00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:52.930
For example, due to on-demand
and elastic nature of Cloud,

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:56.840
procurement is now
pushed to the edge.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:00.680
Engineers can now spend company
money by spending resources

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.570
