00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.540
Once you know what
makes up your cost,

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.530
the next step is to optimize.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:24.190
So let's look at the
equation for Cloud cost.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:28.350
It is resources used
multiplied by the rate paid

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.950
